    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a stressed father who has to balance taking care of his toddler while simultaneously making sure the restaurant they are at stays in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLEASE STOP CRYING: Terrible Twos is a horror game with a design of emulating the stress one may experience when taking a toddler to a public restaurant. Ever feel like you don't want to cook? It may even be worse when you go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced FPS, lighthearted horror game where your goals are to fix up any mess your toddler made, whilst keeping said toddler from crying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the crazy tasks ranging from cleaning, cooking to even playing instruments to achieve a record time and the honorable title of &quot;DAD OF THE YEAR&quot;. Or choose an alternative, less honorable ending....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the crispy 90s era graphics for the best experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a stressed father who has to balance taking care of his toddler while simultaneously making sure the restaurant they are at stays in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLEASE STOP CRYING: Terrible Twos is a horror game with a design of emulating the stress one may experience when taking a toddler to a public restaurant. Ever feel like you don't want to cook? It may even be worse when you go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced FPS, lighthearted horror game where your goals are to fix up any mess your toddler made, whilst keeping said toddler from crying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the crazy tasks ranging from cleaning, cooking to even playing instruments to achieve a record time and the honorable title of &quot;DAD OF THE YEAR&quot;. Or choose an alternative, less honorable ending....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the crispy 90s era graphics for the best experience.</p>",
